"surface":"丑","kind":"person","person_id":"e00_pe1_zri_*A","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-114-dongyue","book_id":"b-shiji-114","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji114-dongyue"},{"id":"c-shiji-114-dongyue:p005","text":"餘善已殺郢，威行於國，國民多屬，竊自立為王。繇王不能矯其眾持正。天子聞之，為餘善不足復興師，曰：「餘善數與郢謀亂，而後首誅郢，師得不勞。」因立餘善為東越王，與繇王并處。","annotation_status":"in_progress","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-114-dongyue:m005-0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"餘善","kind":"person","person_id":"ub3_zen_skw","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-114-dongyue:m005-0004","start":4,"end":5,"surface":"郢","kind":"person","person_id":"xp5_39k_w5w","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-114-dongyue:m005-0022","start":22,"end":24,"surface":"繇王","kind":"person","person_id":"e00_pe1_zri_*A","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-114-dongyue:m005-0032","start":32,"end":34,"surface":"天子","kind":"person","person_id":"yqp_nlb_p1p_ACAA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-114-dongyue:m005-0038","start":38,"end":40,"surface":"餘善","kind":"person","person_id":"ub3_zen_skw","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-114-dongyue:m005-0049","start":49,"end":51,"surface":"餘善","kind":"person","person_id":"ub3_zen_skw","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-114-dongyue:m005-0053","start":53,"end":54,"surface":"郢","kind":"person","person_id":"xp5_39k_w5w","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-114-dongyue:m005-0061","start":61,"end":62,"surface":"郢","kind":"person","person_id":"xp5_39k_w5w","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-114-dongyue:m005-0071","start":71,"end":73,"surface":"餘善","kind":"person","person_id":"ub3_zen_skw","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-114-dongyue:m005-0079","start":79,"end":81,"surface":"繇王","kind":"person","person_id":"e00_pe1_zri_*A","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-114-dongyue","book_id":"b-shiji-114","work_id":"w-shiji","so